#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:5
msgid "Arc"
msgstr "圆弧"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:9
msgid "Create arc"
msgstr "创建弧"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:11
msgid "The arc can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "弧只能从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:13
msgid "Select the icon |icon_arc| from `toolbar`_ to add an arc."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_arc| 添加弧 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:17
msgid "icon_arc"
msgstr "图标( Arc)"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click at the position from the start point of the arc in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中从弧的起始点单击位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click at the position from the end point of the arc in the `workspace`_. The"
" default arc has always an angle of 90 degrees."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 弧端点的位置单击。默认弧的角度总是90度。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:21
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:24
msgid "Arc properties"
msgstr "弧属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:26
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "元素部分属性可以在选择该部分时从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:31
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr "如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 信息** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:36
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech arc part from element"
msgstr "图：来自元素的 QElectroTech 弧部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:38
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different arc properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的弧属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:44
msgid ""
"The outline color and the filling color of the part can be defined from a "
"list of pre-defined colors. At the case of the arc part the filling color is"
" **None**."
msgstr "部分的轮廓颜色和填充颜色可以从预定义的颜色列表中定义。如果是弧部分，则填充颜色为 **None**。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:49
msgid ""
"The type of outline representation can be chosen between: Normal "
"(Continuous), Dashed, Dotted or, Dots and dashes."
msgstr "大纲表达式的类型可以在：正常(连续), Dashed, Dotted 或，Dots 和 dustes 之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:54
msgid ""
"The outline thickness (Weight) can be chosen between: None, Thin, Normal, "
"Strong or High."
msgstr "轮廓厚度(重量)可以在：无，细，正常，强或高之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:61
msgid "The coordinates (x, y) from the ellipse center point can be defined."
msgstr "来自椭圆中心点的坐标(x,y)可以被定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Dimensions"
msgstr "尺寸"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:65
msgid ""
"The horizontal and vertical (minimum and maximum or maximum and minimum) "
"diameters from the ellipse can be defined."
msgstr "可以定义椭圆的横向和纵向(最小和最大或最大和最小)直径。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst
msgid "Point"
msgstr "点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:69
msgid ""
"The position of initial point and end point are defined as angle of the "
"radius between the center and the respective point with the horizontal "
"diameter. The angle value follows the mathematical rules, anti-clockwise for"
" positive angles."
msgstr "初始点和端点的位置被定义为中心与相应点之间具有水平直径的半径角，角度值遵循数学规则，反时针为正角。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:72
msgid "Arc extreme points definition"
msgstr "弧极点定义"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:74
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining the arc extreme points from `information "
"panel`_ or `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 或 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 定义弧极点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:79
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech arc extreme point"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 弧极点"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:82
msgid "Arc extreme points definition from information panel"
msgstr "信息面板的弧极点定义"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:84
msgid ""
"Select the arc to display the rectangle properties at `information panel`_."
msgstr "选择在 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示矩形属性的弧 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:85
msgid ""
"Define the start angle, the angle from the diameter of the start point and "
"the horizontal axes."
msgstr "定义起始角，起始点直径和水平轴的角度。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:86
msgid "Define the angle from the initial point and the end point of the arc."
msgstr "从弧的初始点和终点定义角度。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:87
msgid "Press intro."
msgstr "按进士出身。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:88
#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Select none** from **Edit** menu or use ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr "**从** 选择无 **Edit** 菜单或使用 ``Ctrl + Shift + a`` 键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:91
msgid "Arc extreme points definition from workspace"
msgstr "工作空间的弧极点定义"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:93
msgid ""
"Select the arc drawn at the `workspace`_. The arc line changes to red color "
"and the control of the arc ellipse point to blue."
msgstr "选择在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 绘制的弧。 弧线会改变红色，弧椭圆点的控制会变为蓝色 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:94
msgid ""
"Select the arc again. The line continues in red and the points change to "
"green color."
msgstr "再次选择弧。 线以红色继续，点改为绿色 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:95
msgid ""
"Select the arc for third time. The line continues in red and at this time "
"only one extreme points are, the color is pink."
msgstr "第三次选择弧。 线以红色继续，目前只有一个极端点，颜色是粉红色 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/arc.rst:96
msgid "Displace the pink points around the ellipse outline."
msgstr "将椭圆轮廓周围的粉红色点移位。"
